#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "In battle each player has 3 moves per turn."
msgstr "En combat, chaque joueur a 3 mouvements par tour."

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "After these 3 moves, it is the opponent's turn."
msgstr "Après ces 3 mouvements, c'est au tour de l'adversaire."

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "A move can be used to walk, use items, attack or examine what is in front of you."
msgstr "Un mouvement peut-être utilisé pour marcher, utiliser des objets, attaquer ou examiner ce qui devant vous."

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "You should already know the \"%s\" button, it examines objects, plants and people."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "To attack use the \"%s\" button. In this way you punch the enemy in front of you."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "Otherwise, throw snowballs with the \"%s\" button in the direction you are looking at."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "If you run out of snowballs, get some snow from the snowdrifts around you."
msgstr "Si vous n'avez plus de boules de neige, récupérez de la neige dans les congères autour de vous."

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "Mines you place under you with the \"%s\" button explode as soon as an enemy steps on them."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "Remember, enemies also have HP. Hit them multiple times to knock them out!"
msgstr "Rappelez-vous, les ennemis ont des PV aussi. Frappez-les plusieurs fois pour les éliminer !"

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "And if you have few HP take advantage of a move you have available to eat or drink something you have in your backpack!"
msgstr "Et si vous avez peu de PV, profitez d'un mouvement que vous avez pour manger ou boire quelque chose que vous avez dans votre sac à dos !"

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "That's all. Good luck!"
msgstr "C'est tout. Bonne chance !"

